    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Clonguish Court Newtownforbes, a modern and popular development of quality homes.\r\nWell placed in the centre of this beautiful village these homes offer quality and convenience.\r\nNo. 42 is a two bedroom town house extending to 64 sq. mtrs (688 sq.ft.).\r\n\r\nAccommodation Includes  : \r\nEntrance Hall  :  2.5 x 1.9 Laminate flooring.\r\nGround floor W.C.  :  1.3 X 1.4  Tiled floor.\r\nKitchen / Living area  :  6.3 x 3.9. Mix of laminate and tiled flooring. Elec. Fire with surround, Patio doors to garden, under stairs storage area.\r\nBedroom 1.  :  2.9 x 3.9.  Built in Wardrobe.\r\nBedroom 2.  :  2.7 x 2.9. Built-in wardrobe.\r\nBathroom  :  1.8 X 2.0. Elec. Shower over Bath, Wall & floor tiling.\r\n\r\nServices  : Mains water & sewerage, ESB supply, Electric heating. \r\n\r\nOutside  : Open plan paths and grass areas to front, private, enclosed garden to rear.\r\n\r\nThis is an end, corner house, very well placed within the development. \r\nThere is an access gate / side entrance to rear of property.\r\nThis house is ready to go and ideally suited as starter home or investment property, for those retiring or down-sizing it offers the convenience of all village amenities.\r\nThis may well be the house for you, to arrange your viewing contact John, 043 3341176 or 086 8346559 at any time."
      },
